{
  "summary": "The experiment tested a multimodal model integrating resnet50 image encoders with the RNA-only scvi_n200 baseline (multiprofile, avgpool) using concat fusion. Validation accuracy (0.6315) and F1 (0.6068) are lower than the RNA-only state-of-the-art (0.6501 accuracy), suggesting multimodal integration may not improve performance in this configuration. Uncertainty remains about the effectiveness of concat fusion and potential benefits of alternative modalities or encoders, as this setup isolates only the fusion method without testing other multimodal variations."
}

